# =============================================================================
# Deidentified example data — committed to the repository
# =============================================================================
# The extension-based rules above (*.db, *.xlsx, *.json) and the directory
# rules (/exports/) would block these files. Negation rules below override
# them so the examples/ directory is fully tracked.
!examples/
!examples/**
!examples/**/*.db
!examples/**/*.xlsx
!examples/**/*.json